# W31b, host a (k10): hosts Dry Land; with b and c in its stage group a plays through stag0201 to matz01 (explore: the
# straight walk of "mat" stuck at a wall in run b1) and, its prompt's owner, answers Yes once b stands on the mat too;
# b says No: a goes into dng204b1 alone.
# (It heals from the L panel at 350 HP on the way to matz01: stag0201's mummies felled W31b's b in run d1.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
idle until present=3,sealed>=300 or epoch>=@420 fail stagechange
log b and c joined
explore matz01 yes 2 until stage=dng204b1,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@900
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 yes 2 until stage=dng204b1,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@900
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 yes 2 until stage=dng204b1,control fail epoch>=@900
log a in dng204b1
idle until epoch>=@1000
